  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「30 MINUTES SISTERS」シリーズに新たなシスター「30MS SIS-F00 ユフィア[カラーA]」が登場！",
      "en": "A new sister \"30MS SIS-F00 Yuffia [Color A]\" is now available in the \" 30 MINUTES SISTERS\" series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キャラクター素体、タンポ印刷を施した３種類の表情パーツ、アーマーパーツがセット。",
      "en": "• Set includes character body, three types of facial parts with tampo printing, and armor parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「カラーA」のフェイスパーツにはタンポ印刷を採用。「通常」「笑顔」「叫び」の３種からポージングに合わせた表情の付け替えを楽しめる。",
      "en": "• \"Color A \" face parts use tampo printing. You can enjoy changing the expression according to the pose from three types: \" normal \", \" smiling \", and \" screaming\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 歯のパーツを分割して構成、取り付けは選択式。",
      "en": "• The tooth parts are divided into parts, and installation is selective."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰アーマーは多軸可動、刷新した構造で自然な立膝のポーズで飾ることができる。",
      "en": "• The waist armor is multi-axis movable and has a new structure that allows it to be displayed in a natural kneeling pose."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 背面には、シールドとハンマーを装着可能。",
      "en": "• Seals and hammers can be attached to the back."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ヘアスタイルは繊細なデザインで個性を際立たせている。",
      "en": "• Her hairstyle has a delicate design that highlights her individuality."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「30 MINUTES SISTERS」はフェイスパーツ/ヘアスタイルパーツ/ボディパーツを部位ごとにラインアップ展開。別売りのパーツと組み替えて自分好みのシスターを創ることができる。",
      "en": "• \"30 MINUTES SISTERS\" offers a lineup of face parts, hairstyle parts, and body parts by body part. You can create your own sister by combining parts sold separately."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 30 MINUTES LABEL共通の3mmジョイントを採用。「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」のパーツもオプションとして装着が可能。(※「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」キットの対象年齢は8才以上です)",
      "en": "• Adopts 3mm joint common to 30 MINUTES LABEL. \"30 MINUTES MISSIONS \" parts can also be installed as options. (*\" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" Kit is for ages 8 and up)"
    }
  ],
